.TH OXIGUITAR-INSTALL-SOUNDS 1 "2026" "oxiguitar-bettersounds-soundfonts" "User commands"
.SH NAME
oxiguitar-install-sounds \- download OxiGuitar's recommended sound sets
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B oxiguitar-install-sounds
[\fB\-\-list\fR] [\fB\-\-sets\fR \fINAMES\fR] [\fB\-\-dir\fR \fIDIR\fR] [\fB\-\-system\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-uninstall\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows each sound set with its size, licence, author and download hosts,
asks for confirmation, then downloads the files, checks each against a
pinned SHA-256 and installs them with an oxiguitar-set.json and a
CREDITS.txt. Nothing is downloaded before you confirm.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-list
Show the sets and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-sets " NAMES"
Install these sets (comma-separated), or "all". Without it you are asked.
.TP
.BI \-\-dir " DIR"
Install into DIR instead of your OxiGuitar soundfonts folder.
.TP
.B \-\-system
Install for every user, into /usr/share/oxiguitar/soundfonts (as root).
.TP
.B \-\-yes
Do not ask for confirmation; installs all sets unless \-\-sets is given.
.TP
.B \-\-uninstall
Remove the sets named with \-\-sets.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/mateusrdp/oxiguitar-bettersounds-soundfonts
